{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iMUv47EmgC1793717103.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>製藥企業輝瑞第三季收入，好過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>按年微跌至165.8億美元，但仍高過市場預期的158.7億美元。盈利下跌百分之8，至32.4億美元。經調整每股盈利維持於0.87美元，高過市場預期的0.73美元。</p><p></p><p>集團上調全年收入預測，由至少605億美元上調到至少620億美元。全年經調整每股盈利，由至少2.8美元調高到至少有2.95美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:41:33.399644+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:17.774058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:38:33.364586+00:00","content_hash":"aa609a82c4dd4fd05dd13cac9ca9a097e603ac0ab51fc0f3686589af7e25b50a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:41:33.399644+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}